  "worked_solution": "We can write the system in the form $Ax=b,$ where\n\n$$\nA=[\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 & 8 \\\\ 2 & -5 & 4 \\\\ 5 & -4 & 7\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the coefficient matrix,\n\n$$\nb=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of constants, and\n\n$$\nx=[\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nis the column vector of variables.\n\nSo, the equation $Ax=b$ becomes\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}3 & 2 & 8 \\\\ 2 & -5 & 4 \\\\ 5 & -4 & 7\\end{aligned}][\\begin{aligned}x \\\\ y \\\\ z\\end{aligned}]=[\\begin{aligned}0 \\\\ 3 \\\\ -2\\end{aligned}].\n$$\n\nTherefore, $a=8,\\,b=-5,\\,c=-4.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
